LAMMPS (19 Nov 2024 - Development - patch_19Nov2024-56-ga78aee5731)
#------------------------Silica Melt Simulation------------------#

#Initial setup
units           metal
dimension       3
processors      * * *
boundary        p p p

#----------------------------Setup----------------------------------#
#Creating new box
atom_style      atomic

read_data       ../../structures/Al.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (4.03893 4.03893 4.03893)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  4 atoms
  read_data CPU = 0.005 seconds
replicate       5 5 5
Replication is creating a 5x5x5 = 125 times larger system...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (20.19465 20.19465 20.19465)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  500 atoms
  replicate CPU = 0.001 seconds

#lattice        fcc 4.05
#region	box block 0 10 0 10 0 10 units lattice
#create_box	1 box
#create_atoms 1 box

#mass 1 26.98




#-------------------------------Potential--------------------------#

pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../../../../modal_app/potentials/EAM/Al99.eam.alloy Al

neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 check yes
variable		dt equal 0.001
timestep        ${dt}
timestep        0.001

#-----------------------Thermo Output---------------------------------------------#

thermo          1000
thermo_style    custom step atoms temp pe ke press lx ly lz density
# thermo_modify 	lost ignore flush yes
# write_data		initial_system_ppp.dat

# Uniform distribution of atom as per velocities
velocity        all create 300.0 5812775 dist gaussian
fix             101 all nvt temp 300 300 $(100.0*dt)
fix             101 all nvt temp 300 300 0.10000000000000000555
run             10000
Neighbor list info ...
  update: every = 1 steps, delay = 0 steps, check = yes
  max neighbors/atom: 2000, page size: 100000
  master list distance cutoff = 8.28721
  ghost atom cutoff = 8.28721
  binsize = 4.143605, bins = 5 5 5
  1 neighbor lists, perpetual/occasional/extra = 1 0 0
  (1) pair eam/alloy, perpetual
      attributes: half, newton on
      pair build: half/bin/atomonly/newton
      stencil: half/bin/3d
      bin: standard
